.SH NAME
ktm-guide-strings \- Strings (chapter 11 of the ktm language guide)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
ktm has three ways to hold text. A \fBString\fR is text you own: it grows and you free it. A \fBu8[]\fR is a view of text someone else owns: what functions take to read text. A \fBu8 *\fR is a C string, for C functions. This chapter covers all three and how they convert.
.PP
